{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261015/photo/bkn-20261015120137244-1015_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261015164707\"/><p>女工右手受傷送院。(趙瑞麟攝)</p><p>大圍發生工業意外。今日(15日)早上11時28分，一名姓吳(58歲)女工在車公廟路18號一商場食肆工作期間，意外被切肉機夾住右手；在場人士欲救無從，慌忙報案求助。救援人員奉召而至，迅速救出事主，她的右手紅腫，交由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院治療。事故原因有待相關部門調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T09:02:32.778040+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T13:38:10.095806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:58:02.697327+00:00","content_hash":"887dc56c2fb781347b9183eb8950126ba1bf9b8263a880090dc49a4db7cd94fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}